input_prompt: Explain what on-device AI means in simple terms.
On-device AI means using artificial intelligence (AI) technology that runs directly on your device, like your phone or computer, instead of relying on a separate server or cloud. 

So, imagine you have a smart assistant on your phone that can understand your voice and help you with tasks. With on-device AI, that assistant is built into your device, so it can process information and make decisions without needing to send your data to the internet. 

This makes your device more private and efficient, because your data stays on your device and doesn’t have to travel to a remote server.

